        "product_summary": "Dial-and-cord closure: A rotary dial draws the front cord through paired fabric guides, offering an alternative to traditional tied laces.\nLayered upper design: Grained stitched overlays frame the mesh sections on the toe and side panels for a clearly defined outdoor-style appearance.\nLow-top profile: A dark textile collar and rear pull loop accompany the rounded black forefoot overlay.\nSculpted sole details: Grey or brown sidewalls meet angular black tread blocks, visible in the actual wearing photographs.\nTwo-colour EU 39–48 range: Choose Grey or Dark Brown and specify the size mix for your wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
